# AI Capstone Project

## Project Overview

This capstone project integrates the knowledge gained throughout the Applied AI & Robotics program into a complete end-to-end Artificial Intelligence solution.

## Objectives

- Combine Machine Learning, Computer Vision, and NLP
- Design a complete AI pipeline
- Build a production-ready AI application
- Evaluate model performance
- Demonstrate professional software engineering practices

